    {
      "n": 11,
      "command": "nextLine",
      "spoken": "main landmark, heading, level 1, Behind the Founding of i 2i",
      "durationMs": 1279,
      "offsetMs": 14047
    },
    {
      "n": 12,
      "command": "nextLine",
      "spoken": "In the diverse landscape of the State of Illinois, thousands of organizations diligently engage",
      "durationMs": 1282,
      "offsetMs": 15329
    },
    {
      "n": 13,
      "command": "nextLine",
      "spoken": "with communities, striving to make a difference. However, the struggle with capacity remains a",
      "durationMs": 1284,
      "offsetMs": 16613
    },
    {
      "n": 14,
      "command": "nextLine",
      "spoken": "common challenge, exacerbated by historical disinvestment that has left many grassroots",
      "durationMs": 1279,
      "offsetMs": 17891
    },
    {
      "n": 15,
      "command": "nextLine",
      "spoken": "organizations vulnerable and at risk of dissolution.",
      "durationMs": 1278,
      "offsetMs": 19170
    },
    {
      "n": 16,
      "command": "nextLine",
      "spoken": "These organizations face fundamental challenges and organizational needs that demand urgent",
      "durationMs": 1280,
      "offsetMs": 20450
    },
    {
      "n": 17,
      "command": "nextLine",
      "spoken": "attention. i 2i emerged as a response to this pressing issue, aiming to be a transformative force.",
      "durationMs": 1276,
      "offsetMs": 21726
    },
    {
      "n": 18,
      "command": "nextLine",
      "spoken": "Its inception acknowledges the precarious position of grassroots organizations and their essential",
      "durationMs": 1284,
      "offsetMs": 23010
    },
    {
      "n": 19,
      "command": "nextLine",
      "spoken": "role in community well-being amid historical disinvestments.",
      "durationMs": 1278,
      "offsetMs": 24288
    },
    {
      "n": 20,
      "command": "nextLine",
      "spoken": "Historical disinvestment has cast a shadow over the resilience of grassroots organizations, and i 2i",
      "durationMs": 1282,
      "offsetMs": 25570
    },
    {
      "n": 21,
      "command": "nextLine",
      "spoken": "stands committed to addressing these challenges. Firm in the belief that with the right resources",
      "durationMs": 1276,
      "offsetMs": 26846
    },
    {
      "n": 22,
      "command": "nextLine",
      "spoken": "and assistance, these grassroots organizations can not only weather the storm but thrive.",
      "durationMs": 1280,
      "offsetMs": 28126
    },
    {
      "n": 23,
      "command": "nextLine",
      "spoken": "i 2i focuses on grassroots organizations dedicated to changing the circumstances of violence in",
      "durationMs": 1277,
      "offsetMs": 29403
    },
    {
      "n": 24,
      "command": "nextLine",
      "spoken": "their communities. By providing essential support, i 2i becomes a resource to ensure that their",
      "durationMs": 1272,
      "offsetMs": 30676
    },
    {
      "n": 25,
      "command": "nextLine",
      "spoken": "capacity is not merely sustained but elevated, guiding them on a path to sustainability.",
      "durationMs": 1276,
      "offsetMs": 31952
    },
    {
      "n": 26,
      "command": "nextLine",
      "spoken": "Together, we shape a future where capacity is not a barrier but a steppingstone to sustained impact.",
      "durationMs": 1276,
      "offsetMs": 33228
    },
    {
      "n": 27,
      "command": "nextLine",
      "spoken": "heading, level 2, i 2i Overview",
      "durationMs": 1277,
      "offsetMs": 34505
    },
    {
      "n": 28,
      "command": "nextLine",
      "spoken": "heading, level 3, Welcome to Institute to Innovate (i 2i)",
      "durationMs": 1277,
      "offsetMs": 35782
    },
    {
      "n": 29,
      "command": "nextLine",
      "spoken": "i 2i, an initiative launched by the Illinois Criminal Justice Information Authority (ICJIA), is an",
      "durationMs": 1276,
      "offsetMs": 37058
    },
    {
      "n": 30,
      "command": "nextLine",
      "spoken": "innovative, capacity-building hub, that empowers statewide community-based organizations by providing",
      "durationMs": 1284,
      "offsetMs": 38342
    },
    {
      "n": 31,
      "command": "nextLine",
      "spoken": "tailored support to, strengthen infrastructure, increase sustainability, and address critical",
      "durationMs": 1274,
      "offsetMs": 39616
    },
    {
      "n": 32,
      "command": "nextLine",
      "spoken": "capacity needs, dot",
      "durationMs": 1269,
      "offsetMs": 40885
    },
    {
      "n": 33,
      "command": "nextLine",
      "spoken": "heading, level 3, What exactly is capacity building?",
      "durationMs": 1277,
      "offsetMs": 42162
    },
    {
      "n": 34,
      "command": "nextLine",
      "spoken": "Capacity building is the intentional process of, developing and strengthening the skills, systems,",
      "durationMs": 1279,
      "offsetMs": 43440
    },
    {
      "n": 35,
      "command": "nextLine",
      "spoken": "processes, and resources, an organization needs to operate effectively and sustainably.",
      "durationMs": 1278,
      "offsetMs": 44718
    },
    {
      "n": 36,
      "command": "nextLine",
      "spoken": "i 2i is dedicated to providing support to grassroots organizations and community groups by",
      "durationMs": 1276,
      "offsetMs": 45994
    },
    {
      "n": 37,
      "command": "nextLine",
      "spoken": "strengthening their capacity.",
      "durationMs": 1280,
      "offsetMs": 47274
    },
    {
      "n": 38,
      "command": "nextLine",
      "spoken": "block quote, graphic, Delrice Adams",
      "durationMs": 1275,
      "offsetMs": 48548
    },
    {
      "n": 39,
      "command": "nextLine",
      "spoken": "Our commitment to public safety starts with an ongoing investment in you, ensuring lasting impact.",
      "durationMs": 1278,
      "offsetMs": 49827
    },
    {
      "n": 40,
